title: Finger Used for Download or C2
id: 755df023-755d-41e1-a189-977e9c0ef120
status: experimental
description: Detects finger.exe connecting to a remote host, an obscure LOLBin abused to download data or tunnel command-and-control over the finger protocol.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '\\finger.exe'
    CommandLine|contains: '@'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - ParentImage
falsepositives:
  - Essentially never legitimate on modern Windows
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.command_and_control
  - attack.t1105
